{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sparkle-towers-tebyan-jumeirah-beach-residence-jbr","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":259,"crm_id":"2625","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Sparkle Towers","slug":"sparkle-towers-tebyan-jumeirah-beach-residence-jbr","display_address":"Jumeirah Beach Residence (JBR)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Tebyan Development","price":3050000,"display_price":"3.50M","lattitude":25.0719298,"longitude":55.128979,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sparkle Towers-diamond-shaped towers in JBR, Dubai Marina, Dubai. The complex includes two buildings of 29 and 14 floors. These towers are a must-see as they are decorated with real Swarovski crystals and shine at any time of the day from natural or electric light. Tebyan Real Estate Development Enterprises offers a wide range of apartments. There are only 373 apartments in the towers: These are <strong>studios, 1-3-bedroom apartments,</strong> a residential podium connecting both buildings, and two 4-bedroom penthouses. The entire ground floor is occupied by various retail outlets, cafes and restaurants. The residences are fully furnished and equipped with state-of-the-art appliances.</p><p>The complex has everything you need for a comfortable life: beautiful panoramic windows with double glazing, terraces, gardens, recreation areas, five high-speed elevators, outdoor and indoor swimming pools, fitness center and spa, comfortable and safe parking, separate rooms for private parties, concierge services, Wi-Fi, security and video surveillance.</p><p>Sparkle Towers is located 1.2 km from the Promenade Walk, right on the coast. Nearby are the artificial harbor, Marina Mall, Promenade Walk and many other interesting places. Thanks to the developed transport infrastructure, you can easily reach any part of the city. The city center or DIFC is a 20-minute drive away, and Dubai International Airport is a 30-minute drive away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/bYO3fuLLECEE1m8MjWxBJHRpCQUOGJ3sm1v8sAFc.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/bYO3fuLLECEE1m8MjWxBJHRpCQUOGJ3sm1v8sAFc.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/GBME2AfvVRXVsvv4iLr0HgJjBHSxsGCycM2MXTRB.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/GBME2AfvVRXVsvv4iLr0HgJjBHSxsGCycM2MXTRB.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/zgsefqJ2e9Zd3Ok5MgH3q5WKK1MPs9m5nUz0AbQf.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/zgsefqJ2e9Zd3Ok5MgH3q5WKK1MPs9m5nUz0AbQf.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/Wt7gfBfDoYsxrLWJSqAsgX8IQxPshvmgDw8kh9vc.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/Wt7gfBfDoYsxrLWJSqAsgX8IQxPshvmgDw8kh9vc.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/Y1iqooG48mwT3KxabTfXqjvm3JifDadCL7aD6SQn.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/Y1iqooG48mwT3KxabTfXqjvm3JifDadCL7aD6SQn.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/5gwjrTr7KIHNPvya4NxxPdHKF6fJZRGKzZF0ukJH.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/5gwjrTr7KIHNPvya4NxxPdHKF6fJZRGKzZF0ukJH.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2625/images/2024/07/27/mgYAyCeil7iQ8pqlltmdn1JIMnVASEu7VejSGpzk.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/27/mgYAyCeil7iQ8pqlltmdn1JIMnVASEu7VejSGpzk.jpg","__gg